  "description": "DAHON’s inaugural 700C road bike crafted with D-VELO technology. Built from aviation-grade aluminum, this bike is incredibly lightweight at just 11 kg, delivering exceptional speed for your rides!\n\nEagle Triangle\n\nBuilt in a reinforced oval-tube triangular structure, the Eagle Triangle, combined with the Soaring Toptube and Seatstay, as well as the Dual Curved Cones, constitute the main structure engineered with D-VELO.\n\nBike Handle\n\nProfessional-grade road bike handlebar.\n\nSaddle\n\nErgonomic and adjustable seatpost.\n\nCrankset\n\nDurable crank for extreme performance.\n\nDerailleur\n\nOptimized for smooth shifting.\n\nExceptional Tech Speed Unleashed\n\nEngineered with D-VELO technology, the frame structure boasts a remarkable 32.9% increase in rigidity compared to standard road bike frames, as confirmed by FEA tests. This enhanced rigidity translates to improved speed and a more efficient riding experience.\n\nPowerful Specs Outstanding Performance\n\nThe new DAHON aluminum road bike with \"D-VELO\" technology boasts 20%-30% more rigidity than standard frames. Its superior fork stiffness converts pedal force into speed, making cycling effortless and exhilarating.",
